            "name": "BLITZING FUSILLADE",
            "type": "Battle Tactic",
            "cpCost": 1,
            "legend": "Warriors of Stormlance Task Forces can suddenly pour heavy and accurate fire into the enemy even as they race to finish off any survivors.",
